## igly.ai: AI Image Editing for Product and Marketing Visuals

igly.ai is a browser-based AI image editing platform for creators, ecommerce teams, and small businesses that need polished product visuals without moving between several separate tools.

The platform combines common production tasks such as background removal, inpainting, image upscaling, and generative fill in one visual workflow. It is especially useful for preparing marketplace images, social media assets, ad creatives, and product mockups from raw photos or existing visuals.

## Key Features

- Background removal for product cutouts and clean catalog images.
- Inpainting and object cleanup for fixing small defects or unwanted details.
- Image upscaling for higher-resolution final assets.
- Generative fill for extending, replacing, or adapting visual areas.
- Browser-based workflow for fast edits without a desktop design suite.

## Useful For

igly.ai fits teams that need repeatable visual editing for product listings, ecommerce campaigns, content creation, and lightweight design work. It can help turn source images into usable creative assets faster than a manual Photoshop-style workflow.
